storage module immutable authTestsCoveragePlanSummary String "server/tests/auth_tests.sem coverage: invalid password, bcrypt 72-byte password limit, executable JWT secret config, executable JWT issue-time model, JWT denylist contract, durable refresh-token row model, executable login rate-limit rows, executable login audit events, disabled user, expired token, bad signature, wrong audience, and insufficient role."

operation getAuthTestsCoveragePlan
output operation getAuthTestsCoveragePlan String
memory getAuthTestsCoveragePlan heap no
async getAuthTestsCoveragePlan no
